     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Hi all,</span></font><br><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\">I wonder if anyone can kindly hand me the R script for conducting MANOVA for the nested experimental design (strip split plot)? </span><br></div><div><br></div><div>Best</div><div>Mitra</div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Jan 23, 2018 at 1:54 AM,  <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davi...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #d3d3d3;max-width:850px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000\">\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:10px 20px\">\r\n    <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n      <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"width:70%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:18px/20px arial;color:#333333\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/davis-rug/topics\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:#333333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/davis-rug/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qZovOkS1dXZXwuscnpFB_\">\r\n              davi...@googlegroups.com</a>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"text-align:right;width:30%\">\r\n            <span style=\"font:20px/24px arial\"><a style=\"color:#dd4b39;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39FnFLmWB0gBmmOVLeafoz\">Google Groups</a></span>\r\n          </td>\r\n          <td style=\"width:32px\">\r\n            <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email/#!overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail/%23!overview&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39FnFLmWB0gBmmOVLeafoz\"><img style=\"border:0;vertical-align:middle\" src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/4SGWHe9midrWMDxDIJMQraTMMgnAU71soPZ0D28IOSZcs66TdyRoCqyIhaTt-kwo0YKv2lRo05RkwsGFZdnFhdvy60XdxNlL2U-B=s0-d-e1-ft#http://www.google.com/images/icons/product/groups-32.png\"></a>\r\n          </td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </tbody>\r\n    </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"padding:20px;background-color:#f5f5f5\">\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"font-family:arial;color:#222222;padding:0px\">\r\n  <a name=\"m_-3494936984729420489_m_-6335007659395550521_digest_top\" style=\"font-size:21px\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n  \r\n    Today&#39;s topic summary\r\n  \r\n  \r\n  </a><br>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:11px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/davis-rug/topics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/davis-rug/topics&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3qZovOkS1dXZXwuscnpFB_\">View all topics</a>\r\n  </span>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font:13px/18px arial;color:#222222;padding:0px;margin-bottom:30px\">\r\n  <ul style=\"margin-left:3px;padding-left:0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <li>\r\n      <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-3494936984729420489_m_-6335007659395550521_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\">\r\n      Work session, this MONDAY (1/22) 10-12pm</a> -\r\n      <span style=\"color:#777777\">5 Updates</span>\r\n    </li>\r\n  \r\n  </ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_-3494936984729420489_m_-6335007659395550521_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/t/f51a65c42d59258d?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/t/f51a65c42d59258d?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kUB0S9ZqaXRBlNogfZXZy\">\r\n      Work session, this MONDAY (1/22) 10-12pm\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tbody><tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Michael Hannon &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">jmhannon...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Jan 21 08:16PM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hi, Hannah.  I haven&#39;t used Overleaf (but I can see some use for it among<br>\r\nsome people I work with).  And I&#39;ve personally used knitr/rmarkdown only to<br>\r\nproduce documents for my colleagues.\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/2fe6ad89eaeec?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/2fe6ad89eaeec?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1e34on108tWRHzzp08ktCZ\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Ryan Peek &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rap...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;: Jan 21 10:12PM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hi all,<br>\r\n <br>\r\nA few thoughts. Great suggestion for a workshop, however, I&#39;m not sure the<br>\r\nD-RUG is the best place to have a LaTeX talk (unless we have a volunteer<br>\r\nwilling!). But, a recent UC Davis grad,\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/304bfce97fa00?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/304bfce97fa00?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10Ses7gDP8lDcszyQXWG6-\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        &quot;C. Titus Brown&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ctb...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;: Jan 22 05:32AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      I or someone in my group would, I&#39;m sure, be happy to give an intro<br>\r\nto LaTeX and overleaf; we use LaTeX for lots of things, overleaf<br>\r\nat least occasionally.<br>\r\n <br>\r\nBut beware - LaTeX is like programming.\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/31cc3cd22a5d6?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/31cc3cd22a5d6?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3On4ud14giypj0Z3_HzjWt\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Hannah Waterhouse &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hwate...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;: Jan 22 09:36AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      thank you everyone for your replies and resources! I know a few of us would<br>\r\nbe interested in another workshop but totally understand if it&#39;s too much<br>\r\nto organize - I&#39;m happy just listening to\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/32a104b104d42?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/32a104b104d42?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1j71b5mHSet_G1bpUMRmDj\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Matthieu Stigler &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">mmst...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;: Jan 22 09:36AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Hi Hannah<br>\r\n <br>\r\nAdding a few thought to the topic. First of all, knitr is not only about<br>\r\nmarkdown, but also LaTeX. So in general you would not use Sweave anymore,<br>\r\nbut knitr instead, then choose whether\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/32a121f11d765?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/msg/32a121f11d765?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lhUJzX9oT2qJfdfAM7ydb\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </tbody></table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_-3494936984729420489_m_-6335007659395550521_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:#636363;font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/davis-rug/join\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/davis-rug/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466610615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vfPRw3Ite67PNw-GJiluk\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+